0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4919833366","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116507#issuecomment-4919833366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116507","id":4919833366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJT6zFg","user":{"login":"Samvkes","id":44610150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjEwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44610150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes","html_url":"https://github.com/Samvkes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T22:39:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T08:12:18Z","body":"> @Samvkes I think you might've messed up a rebase, did you intend to close the PR?\r\n\r\nAh yeah, sorry. Was cleaning up some stuff in my master in preparation for another possible pr and must've messed up. Kinda embarrasing, I'll try to fix it tomorrow.\r\n\r\n> To be honest, even if rebased, I would not recommend pursuing due to maintainability concerns. The proposal has gathered little interest overall, and the feature itself can be replicated via other means even if not integrated directly within the engine.\r\n\r\nCan you go into a bit more detail wrt the maintainability concerns? I get that SBF is already kinda bloated, but it's also (in my mind) one of the most common ui primitives in a lot of Godot projects (so I think making every aspect of it as polished as possible is worthwhile). Is the concern that the solution itself is brittle / weird, or that it adds even more parameters to SBF?\r\n\r\nMy experience has been that implementing this effect yourself in a way that's good-looking / performant / reliable can get pretty involved (eg using shaders makes dynamically adjusting the shadow much more of a hassle). Though of course it's doable.\r\n\r\nI don't disagree that the interest in the proposal has been modest, but the reaction to it and this pr seems to be basically only positive, which in my experience is not always true for ui adjustments.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4919833366/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5383218834","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116507#issuecomment-5383218834","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116507","id":5383218834,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQN1mkg","user":{"login":"GeordieTomo","id":58905733,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTA1NzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58905733?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeordieTomo","html_url":"https://github.com/GeordieTomo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeordieTomo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeordieTomo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeordieTomo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeordieTomo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeordieTomo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gith